{"time_ns": 1792760990342130898, "kind": "result", "action_index": 11, "tool": "write_file", "path": "/workspace/report.md", "content_read": false, "written": true, "sha256": "efe4d7b3238c8d54042ae93da41deb4d5e149608a4311e12cdfdb5b9022456e5", "content": "# Regional Totals Summary Report\n\n## Summary\n\nThis report provides a summary of regional transaction totals based on the available records in `/workspace/data/records.csv`.\n\n## Data Availability\n\nThe input file contains **18 records** out of the 24 records (R001-R024) mentioned in the job specification. The following records were processed:\n- R002, R003, R004, R006, R007, R008, R010, R011, R012, R014, R015, R016, R018, R019, R020, R022, R023, R024\n\nMissing records (6 total):\n- R001, R005, R009, R013, R017, R021\n\n## Regional Totals (in cents)\n\n| Region | Total Amount |\n|--------|--------------|\n| North  | 228,137      |\n| South  | 221,810      |\n| West   | 297,365      |\n| **Total** | **747,312** |\n\n## Notes\n\nThe regional distribution shows relatively balanced amounts across regions, with the West region having the highest total at 297,365 cents. The discrepancy between the expected 24 records and the 18 records actually provided in the input file should be investigated.\n", "ok": true}
